      "step_number": 1,
      "text": "Step 1: Given that \\( |a| = |b| = |c| = |d| = 1 \\), we know that \\( a, b, c, d \\) lie on the unit circle in the complex plane. Also, since \\( a + b + c + d = 0 \\), the sum of these points is zero, which implies they form a quadrilateral centered at the origin.",
