      "q_source": "stage2_test_predictions.csv",
      "step_number": 3,
      "text": "Step 3: Since \\( a + b + c + d = 0 \\), the polynomial can be expressed as \\( P(z) = z^4 + pz^2 + q \\) for some constants \\( p \\) and \\( q \\). The condition \\( a + b + c + d = 0 \\) means the coefficient of \\( z^3 \\) is zero.",
