      "text": "Step 4: To find the maximum value of \\( |(a+b)(a+c)(a+d)(b+c)(b+d)(c+d)| \\), we use the fact that if \\( a, b, c, d \\) are the vertices of a square inscribed in the unit circle, then the product of the sums of opposite sides will be maximized.",
